---
---

<section class="pt-24 md:pt-32" id="features">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-400 uppercase">Why it works</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight">
      The redirect is where you lose them.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-stretch">
    <!-- Before: leaky redirect -->
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 opacity-80">
      <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">The old way</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Send them away. Lose them on the way.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Visitor reads your page</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595;</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Clicks your "tip" link</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595; &#8595;</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">New tab opens on someone else's site</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595;</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-dashed border-red-300 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-500">Slow load, unfamiliar page, distraction, closed tab</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595;</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-400 line-through">They never make it to "thank you"</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- After: on-page flow -->
    <div class="rounded-lg border-2 border-black bg-white p-8">
      <p class="font-semibold text-black">With QuietJar</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">They stay right where they are.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Visitor reads your page</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595; in two taps</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border-2 border-black bg-black px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white">Tap the button, pay right there</div>
        <div class="text-center text-slate-400 text-xs">&#8595;</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-green-300 bg-green-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-green-700">"Thank you." No redirect, no drop-off.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
      The supporter never leaves, and far more of them make it all the way to
      "thank you."
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
